	"Name": "Kenneth's Seed Shop",
	"Author": "Kf29",
	"Description": "[size=4][b]Adds a new constructible building -\u00A0Kenneth's Seed Shop (built by Robin) - with 15 new fruit trees and 1 forageable item.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Customization: By default, all 15 fruit tree saplings appear in Shop3. If you prefer a smaller selection and have Generic Mod Config Menu (GMCM) installed, you can disable individual saplings to remove them from the shop. Re-enabling a sapling restores it to Shop3 along with its associated fruit tree and fruit.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]‎More details can be found in ReadMe.txt[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]‎Please do not reupload or include this mod in modpacks without permission.[/b][/size]",
